Breaks: the SQL stores read a ref's cut in three statements (namespaces, tables, views), each its own snapshot, so a cut can hold half of a multi-table commit, or a table without its namespace (D33, backlog 102).
Module: catalog-store-sql
Test: PostgresStoreSuiteTest$Refs#aCutHoldsEveryMultiTableCommitWhole+everyTableInACutHasItsNamespace

